\newlabel{fig:llama_heat}{{4.13}{25}{\textbf {LLaMA~3.1-70B — country–topic heatmaps.} Darker = higher similarity. As with GPT-4o-mini, \emph {Multi-party system} and \emph {Adopt atheism} are relatively stable/high across countries in NvA/NvR, whereas RvA is lighter on \emph {No economic sanctions}, \emph {Compulsory voting}, and \emph {Adopt libertarianism}, indicating stronger persona-driven divergence}{figure.caption.26}{}}
